# ORIGINAL PHOTOS — deliberately not committed.
#
# GitHub Pages on the free plan needs a public repo, and these files still carry
# 16–32 KB of EXIF each, which on phone photos includes the GPS coordinates of
# where they were taken. Publishing that would undo the EXIF stripping that
# scripts/prep-photos.mjs does on purpose.
#
# The web-ready copies in src/assets/photos/ ARE committed and are clean.
# Keep this folder backed up somewhere else — it is the only copy of the
# originals, and `npm run prep-photos` regenerates the site images from it.
resources/fotos/
